<title>INDIA: CRICKET-INDIAN BOARD XI OUT FOR 94 AT CLOSE OF PLAY.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIAN BOARD XI OUT FOR 94 AT CLOSE OF PLAY.</headline>
<dateline>BARODA, India 1996-11-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>At close of play,  the</p>
<p>Indian Board President's XI were all out for 94 in their second</p>
<p>innings on the second day of the three-day match against South</p>
<p>Africa.</p>
<p>Scores: Indian Board President's XI 179 and 94 (De Villiers</p>
<p>4-37, Klusener 3-29, McMillan 3-14), South Africa 206.</p>
</text>
